  "tag": "站务消息",
  "title": "论坛行为规范",
  "excerpt": "论坛支持鼓励原创作品，相关技术讨论。 1）禁止人身攻击 – 请各网友及会员互相尊重，遵守互联网络道德，论坛无条件反对粗鲁、无礼、骚扰和威胁其他会员的言行，反对会员之间超越观点辩论的人身攻击，对于此类言行，管理团队有采取不受限制之管理动作的可",
  "body_html": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><br/><span style=\"color:#FF0000;overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\">论坛支持鼓励原创作品，相关技术讨论。</span></span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word;\"/></span></span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">1）禁止人身攻击 – 请各网友及会员互相尊重，遵守互联网络道德，论坛无条件反对粗鲁、无礼、骚扰和威胁其他会员的言行，反对会员之间超越观点辩论的人身攻击，对于此类言行，管理团队有采取不受限制之管理动作的可能。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">2）禁止重复张贴 - 禁止在各个版面重复张贴同一个主题。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">3）禁止发布非相关帖子，复读机和cookie stuffing。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">i）禁止滥发与论坛主旨无关的帖子 - 发布跟论坛主题不相干的帖子只能浪费访客的时间。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">ii）禁止滥发与版块无关的帖子。违规帖子会被转移到相关版块，如无适当版块则会被关闭。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">iii）禁止复读机或任何复读行为。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">4）禁止违法活动</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">i) 禁止任何人张贴违法的信息，禁止使用本论坛进行任何违反法律的活动。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">ii) 禁止贩卖或传播违法的个人信息，例如身/份/证，护/照等等。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">5）禁止冒犯类信息 - 禁止张贴、转贴和传播任何具有污蔑、污秽、暴力，色/情、辱骂性质的信息；禁止使用冒犯民族和种族的语言。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">6）禁止讨论政治 - 为了保护论坛持续为各网友及会员提供服务服务的能力，论坛不欢迎任何关于政治和相关内容的讨论和链接。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">7）禁止损害论坛利益</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">i) 禁止张贴以损害论坛利益为目的，推销论坛直接竞争对手的帖子，悄悄话，签名和网站链接。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">ii) 禁止以发论坛邀请码或其他福利为理由的引流帖。网站介绍和分享的帖子不在此限，但过量的类似帖子会依13项归类为广告帖。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">8）保护个人隐私 - 禁止张贴他人姓名、住址、电话、照片等个人隐私信息（经本人同意的除外）。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">9）版权保护 - 禁止张贴受版权保护的知识产权作品。凡转贴请并尽量标明原出处和原作者，并请注意原发表处的版权声明，并负担由此可能产生的版权责任。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">10）违规处理 - 论坛管理团队（管理员,超级版主,各版版主）为本规章执行者，其拥有对任何违规行为的处理权利。根据违规的情况和严重程度及某些特殊情况，从编辑帖子，到PM联系警告，到限时禁止登陆，到直至封ID/删除帐户，论坛管理团队拥有一切管理权力。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">11）举报处理 - 凡经证实的第一举报者将给予“论坛金钱”奖励，同时管理可对滥用者进行扣钱动作。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">12）禁止总发帖量（包括回帖）不到100帖的会员对交易帖设置“回帖仅作者可见”选项。</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\">13）广告帖</span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"><strong>i) 广告必须直接发专区[以后开放]，本社区当前禁止开服广告贴</strong></span><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: Tahoma, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, Simsun; font-size: 14px;\"/><br/></p>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
